{"blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "第四章 常用医学检查指标及其临床意义", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第01讲　常用医学检查指标及其临床意义", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第一节　血常规检查", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "一、红细胞计数（RBC） \n　　是血液中数量最多的有形成分，主要生理功能：作为呼吸载体", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "男性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（4.0～5.5）×1012/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "男人四十一枝花", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "女性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（3.5～5.0）×1012/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "女性能顶半边天", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "新生儿", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（6.0～7.0）×1012/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "新生儿：尿流，气人", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "二、血红蛋白（Hb） \n　　血红蛋白在体内的主要作用为运输氧和二氧化碳，血红蛋白能更好地反映贫血的程度。", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "男性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "120～160g/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "男性：打架打120", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "女性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "110～150g/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "女性：打架打110", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "新生儿", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "170～200g/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "三、白细胞计数（WBC） \n　　白细胞是机体抵御病原微生物等异物入侵的重要防线", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "成人", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（4～10）×109/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "成人：事实", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "6个月至2岁", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（11～12）×109/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "幼儿：摇摇儿", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "新生儿", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（15～20）×109/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "新生儿：要我爱你", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "四、白细胞分类计数（DC）", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "中性粒细胞", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "50%～70%", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "林丹中酸碱\n中性：五七\n淋巴：二四", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "中性杆状核粒细胞", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "0～5%", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "嗜酸性粒细胞", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "0.5%～5%", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "嗜碱性粒细胞", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "0%～1%", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "淋巴细胞", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "20%～40%", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "单核细胞", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "3%～8%", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "五、血小板计数、红细胞沉降率", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "指标", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "范围", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "记忆", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血小板（PLT）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（100～300）×109/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "拿板打一小三", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "红细胞沉降率（ESR）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "魏氏法\n男性：0～15mm/h\n女性：0～20mm/h", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "15男孩入红尘\n女性20已成家（沉降）", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "六、C-反应蛋白（CRP） \n　　【正常参考范围】CRP＜2.87mg/L（速率散射比浊法） \n　　【临床意义】CPR升高可伴发于多种疾病导致的急、慢性炎症，包括感染性疾病和非感染性炎症性疾病 \n　　2.87是红线，超了要查炎！", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第二节　尿常规检查", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿液酸碱度（pH）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "随机尿：pH4.5～8.0\n晨尿：pH6.5", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿比重（SG）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "1.015～1.025", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿比重：可以反映肾小管浓缩和稀释功能", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿蛋白（PRO）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "肾损伤", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿葡萄糖（GLU）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "糖尿病", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿胆红素（BIL）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "黄疸、肝细胞损伤", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿沉渣管型", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "肾实质性病变", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "尿酮体（KET）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "糖尿病酮症酸中毒", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第三节　粪常规检查", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "1. 粪外观", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "稀糊状或水样粪便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "腹泻、急性胃肠炎", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "米泔水样便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "霍乱、副霍乱", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "黏液便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小肠炎症（混于粪便中）\n大肠炎症（黏液附着于粪便表面）", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "胨状便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "过敏性肠炎、慢性菌痢", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "脓血便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "细菌性痢疾、溃疡性结肠炎、\n直肠或结肠癌、阿米巴痢疾", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "乳凝块便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "脂肪或酪蛋白消化不良", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "鲜血便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "下消化道出血", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "白陶土便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "梗阻性黄疸", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "细条便", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "直肠狭窄，见于直肠癌", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "2. 粪隐血", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "消化道溃疡", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "胃、十二指肠溃疡者，间歇性阳性", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "消化道肿瘤", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "胃癌、结肠癌患者，持续性阳性", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "其他疾病", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "肠结核、克罗恩病、溃疡性结肠炎；全身性疾病如紫癜、急性白血病、伤寒、回归热、钩虫病等", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第四节　肝功能检查", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血清丙氨酸氨基转移酶（ALT）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "＜40U/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "●肝胆疾病\n●急性心肌梗死等", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血清天门冬氨酸氨基转移酶（AST）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "＜40U/L", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "反映肝细胞损伤程度\n●肝脏疾病", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血清γ-谷氨酰转移酶 （GGT）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 2, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "肝胆疾病、胰腺疾病等", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血清碱性磷酸酶（ALP）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 2, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "肝胆疾病、骨骼疾病", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第五节　肾功能检查", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血清尿素氮（BUN）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "成人：3.2～7.1mmol/L\n儿童：1.8～6.5mmol/L\n升高：肾脏疾病、泌尿系统疾病等", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血清肌酐（SCr）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "男性：53～106μmol/L\n女性：44～97μmol/L\n增高：肾小球滤过功能减退等", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血尿酸（UA）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "当体内核酸大量分解（白血病等其他恶性肿瘤）或食入高嘌呤食物时，将引起血尿酸水平升高", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第六节　其他常用血液生化检查", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "淀粉酶（AMY）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "AMY增高，急性胰腺炎", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "肌酸激酶\n（CK）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "●早期诊断急性心肌梗死（AMI）的灵敏指标之一\n●三种类型同工酶：CK-BB、CK-MM、CK-MB", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "心肌肌钙蛋白\n（cTn）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "cTnT、cTnⅠ均可用于诊断心肌梗死以及判断微小心肌缺血性损伤", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "血糖", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "【正常参考范围】\n空腹血糖（FBG）：3.9～6.1mmol/L\n餐后2小时血糖：＜7.8mmol/L\n血糖增高：胰岛素功能低下、导致血糖升高的激素分泌增多、其他疾病等\n血糖降低：胰岛素分泌过多、导致血糖升高的激素分泌减退、其他疾病、应用磺酰脲类促胰岛素分泌剂过量等", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "3961看空腹\n78小于两小时", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 3, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "糖化血红蛋白：反映过去3个月的平均血糖水平，其增高主要见于糖尿病及其他高血糖状态", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "总胆固醇\n（TC）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "●正常参考范围：＜5.20mmol/L\n●血清中总胆固醇的浓度可以作为评估脂类代谢的指标", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "甘油三酯\n（TG）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "●正常参考范围：0.56～1.70mmol/L\n●增高：冠心病、动脉粥样硬化、原发性高脂血症、家族性高三酰甘油血症等", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "高密度脂蛋白\n胆固醇\n（HDL-C）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "●正常参考范围：1.03～2.07mmol/L\n●HDL-C水平与动脉粥样硬化和冠心病的发生和发展呈负相关", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "高——High1327不会高", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "低密度脂蛋白\n（LDL-C）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "●正常参考范围：≤3.4mmol/L\n●LDL-C的含量与心血管疾病的发病率以及病变程度相关，被认为是动脉粥样硬化的主要致病因子", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "低——LOW\n小于34真的low", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第七节　乙型肝炎血清免疫学检查", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "乙肝病毒标志物六项：", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "项目", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "结果", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "临床意义", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "表面抗原\n（HBsAg）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "阳性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "感染HBV的标志\n（1）乙肝潜伏期和急性期\n（2）急性或慢性肝炎、肝硬化、肝癌\n（3）HBsAg携带者", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "表面抗体\n（抗-HBs）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "对HBV有免疫力\n（1）乙肝恢复期\n（2）曾经感染过乙肝病毒\n（3）接种乙肝疫苗后", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "e抗原\n（HBeAg）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "HBV复制的标志\n（1）乙肝活动期，高度传染性\n（2）持续阳性提示转为慢性乙肝，预后不良\n（3）HBsAg和HBeAg均为阳性的妊娠期女性，可将HBV传播给新生儿，其感染的阳性率为70%～90%", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "e抗体\n（抗-HBe）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": []}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（1）HBV被清除或抑制，复制减少，传染性降低：出现于HBeAg转阴之后（即HBeAg转阴而抗抗-HBe阳性）\n（2）其他：部分慢性乙型肝炎、肝硬化、肝癌患者", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "核心抗体\n（抗-HBc）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "抗HBc-IgM阳性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "HBV复制活跃且传染性强\n急性乙肝的诊断指标", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": []}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "抗HBc-IgG阳性", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "急性HBV感染后可一直存在", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "“大三阳”与“小三阳”", "images": []}, {"type": "table", "rows": [[{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "项目", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "阳性", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "大三阳：\nHBsAg（+）\nHBeAg（+）\n抗-HBc（+）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（1）HBV在人体内复制活跃，传染性强\n（2）如同时见ALT及AST升高，为最具有传染性的一类肝炎，应尽快隔离", "images": []}]}], [{"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "小三阳：\nHBsAg（+）\n抗-HBe（+）\n抗-HBc（+）", "images": []}]}, {"span": 1, "blocks": [{"type": "paragraph", "text": "（1）HBV在体内复制减少，传染性低\n（2）如肝功能正常，又无症状，称为乙型肝炎病毒无症状携带者，不需要隔离", "images": []}]}]]}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "第八节　甲状腺功能检查", "images": []}, {"type": "paragraph", "text": "（1）游离三碘甲状腺原氨酸（FT3）：对鉴别甲状腺功能正常、亢进或减退有重要意义，对甲状腺功能亢进症（甲亢）的诊断高度敏感，是诊断T3型甲亢的特异性指标。 \n　　（2）游离四碘甲状腺原氨酸（FT4）：临床常规诊断甲状腺疾病的重要依据之一，可作为甲状腺抑制治疗的监测手段。 \n　　（3）促甲状腺激素（TSH）：反映甲状腺功能最敏感、最有价值的客观指标 \n　　FT3查甲亢，FT4看抑制，TSH最灵敏！ \n　　【最佳选择题】 \n　　血小板计数正常值参考范围是 \n　　A.（10～50）×109/L \n　　B.（50～100）×109/L \n　　C.（100～300）×109/L \n　　D.（300～500）×109/L \n　　E.（500～700）×109/L \n　　『正确答案』C \n　　『答案解析』血小板计数正常值参考范围是（100～300）×109/L。 \n\n　　导致血清碱性磷酸酶（ALP）升高的疾病是 \n　　A.心肌梗死 \n　　B.溶血性疾病 \n　　C.胸腔积液 \n　　D.骨骼疾病 \n　　E.前列腺肿瘤 \n　　『正确答案』D \n　　『答案解析』ALP增高可见于以下疾病。①肝胆疾病：梗阻性黄疸、胆道梗阻、胰头癌、急性或慢性黄疸型肝炎、肝癌等。②骨骼疾病：骨损伤、骨疾病、变形性骨炎（Paget病），使成骨细胞内有高度的ALP释放入血；纤维性骨炎、骨折恢复期、佝偻病、骨软化症、成骨不全症等，因为ALP生成亢进，血清ALP活性升高。 \n\n　　某男，35岁。暴饮暴食后会出现上腹部痛，伴恶心、呕吐、发热，检验结果显示血清淀粉酶活性显著增高，提示的疾病是 \n　　A.急性胆囊炎 \n　　B.急性胃肠炎 \n　　C.急性心肌梗死 \n　　D.急性肾炎 \n　　E.急性胰腺炎 \n　　『正确答案』E \n　　『答案解析』血清淀粉酶活性测定主要用于急性胰腺炎的诊断。", "images": []}]}